["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/countyCode", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "A code that identifies a county. A county is a territorial division in some countries, often forming a primary unit of local administration.\n\nIn the US, a county is a political and administrative division of a state.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
