["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Software/homePage", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "A homePage is a place for the SPDX document creator to record a website that\nserves as the package's home page.\n\nThis saves the recipient of the SPDX document who is looking for more info from\nhaving to search for and verify a match between the package and the associated\nproject home page.\n\nThis link can also be used to reference further information about the package\nreferenced by the SPDX document creator.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
