["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Dataset/datasetType", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "Describes the datatype contained in the dataset.\n\nFor example, a dataset can be an image dataset for computer vision applications, a text dataset such as the contents of a book or Wikipedia article, or sometimes a multimodal dataset that contains multiple types of data.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/Requirement", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label", "Requirement", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/ProfileIdentifierType/operations", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "The element follows the Operations profile specification.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/SupplyChain/CreateAction", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "CreationAction represents the lifecycle event of Product creation. A product could be manufactured, assembled, mined/extracted directly from the nature etc.\n\nRelationship:\n\nFor each CreateAction there is at least one /Core/Relationship class or subclass with the relationshipType of 'hasOutput\u2019 on the from and a /Core/Element class or subclass on the to.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["_:N519018509a524b4ebc1735d6606d2684", "http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount", "2", "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer", "", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/FunctionalSafety/VerificationType/inspection", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition", "A thorough examination or checking of documentation, records, processes, or systems to confirm compliance or adherence. An inspection needs to have a defined set of acceptance criteria (e.g. a checklist), a documentation of roles involved in the inspection (e.g. to document the inspector's independence) and a clear documentation of when and how it was performed.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/RelationshipCompleteness/incomplete", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "The relationship is known not to be exhaustive.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["_:Neacbc417b7d441e4bc3521f12049dbc5", "http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#class", "https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/SupplyChain/AssemblyProcess", "globalId", "", ""]
