["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Software/ContentIdentifier", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "A ContentIdentifier is a canonical, unique, immutable identifier of the content\nof a software artifact, such as a package, a file, or a snippet.\n\nIt can be used for verifying its identity and integrity.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
