["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/AI/modelExplainability", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "A free-form text that lists the different explainability mechanisms and how\nthey can be used to explain the results from the AI model.\n\nThe mechanisms can be model-agnostic methods, such as\nSHapley Additive exPlanations (SHAP) <https://shap.readthedocs.io/> and\nLocal Interpretable Model-agnostic Explanations (LIME) <https://github.com/marcotcr/lime>,\nand model-specific methods that applied to a limited category of models.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/AI/energyConsumption", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type", "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty", "globalId", "", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/ExternalIdentifierType/ibid", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition", "International Business Identifier (IBID) <https://ekys.org/business_identifiers/> is a verifiable unique identifier for legal entities as defined in the ISO/DIS 25500-3 <https://www.iso.org/standard/87705.html> draft standard. It is composed of three data elements: the International Business Registration Number (IBRN), the legal name, and the date of origin formatted as eight numeric characters (YYYYMMDD). Each element is separated by a pipe character (|) (e.g., US-DE.BER:3031657|Code Management Association|19990420).", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Security/VexAffectedVulnAssessmentRelationship", "http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#property", "_:Nf6b94315de2a45d6b3602adcc87ea2fc", "localId", "", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/rationale", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition", "A rationale is supporting information that provides the underlying\njustification or reasoning for an associated element, decision, or process.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
