["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/AI/energyConsumption", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "Energy consumption of an AI model, either known or estimated.\n\nIn the absence of direct measurements, an SPDX data creator may choose to\nestimate the energy consumption based on information about computational\nresources (e.g., number of floating-point operations), training time, and other\nrelevant training details.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
