["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/SupplyChain/State", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition", "A state is an instance that describes what a system, component, subsystem, process, or project has achieved at any given time.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
