["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/SupplyChain/ResponsibilityChangeProcess", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "The process changes of responsibility are recorded in this process. Responsibility Change refers to the transfer of rights, responsibilities, and/or control of an asset, property, business, or entity from one party to another.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
