["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Software/Snippet", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "A Snippet describes a certain part of a file and can be used when the file is\nknown to have some content that has been included from another original source.\n\nSnippets are useful for denoting when part of a file may have been originally\ncreated under another license or copied from a place with a known\nvulnerability.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
