["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/SupplyChain/currentState", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "The state of an object refers to a string assigned to its attributes (or properties) at a given moment in time. The state describes the current condition or behavior of the object.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/specVersion", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition", "Provides a reference number that can be used to understand how to parse and\ninterpret an Element.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
