["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/SupplyChain/DestroyAction", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "The action of destroying an element is recorded as part of the DestroyAction. To destroy refers to the act of completely eliminating, or rendering something unusable or irretrievable.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
