["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Software/packageUrl", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "A package URL (commonly pronounced and referred to as \"purl\") is an attempt to standardize package representations\nin order to reliably identify and locate software packages.\nA packageUrl is a URL string which represents a package in a\nmostly universal and uniform way across programming languages, package\nmanagers, packaging conventions, tools, APIs and databases.\n\nA packageUrl is composed of seven components:\n\nscheme:type/namespace/name@version?qualifiers#subpath\n\n\nThe definition for each component can be found in the corresponding\nAnnex of this document.\nKnown type definitions can be found in the\nPackage URL type definitions <https://github.com/package-url/purl-spec/blob/b33dda1cf4515efa8eabbbe8e9b140950805f845/PURL-TYPES.rst>.\n\nComponents are designed such that they form a hierarchy from the most\nsignificant on the left to the least significant components on the right.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/IntegrityMethod", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition", "Provides an independently reproducible mechanism that permits verification of a specific Element.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Operations/weight", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition", "Weight to express relevance in de minimis consideration.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/SupplyChain/StateAction", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "The state of a specific Element is defined, measured or observed in this class at a specific moment in time.\nThe stateaction is defined by the method used by the definedstaeproces to produce an outcome.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Service/serviceHostingCountry", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label", "serviceHostingCountry", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
