["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Build/configSourceDigest", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "configSourceDigest is the checksum of the build configuration file used by a\nbuilder to execute a build, according to the buildType.\n\nThis property uses the Core model's Hash class.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
