["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/IndividualElement", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "Individuals, such as NoneElement and NoAssertionElement, need to reference a\nconcrete subclass of Element.\n\nThis class provides the type used by the individuals defined in the Core profile.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/SupplyChain/ManufactureProcess", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "This class represents the process involved in manufacturing products.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/headquartersLocation", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "Headquarters denotes the location where most or all of the important functions of an organization are coordinated. In the United States, the corporate headquarters represents the entity at the center or the top of a corporation taking full responsibility for managing all business activities.\nTo identify an organization's headquarters accurately, you provide address information (mailing, street and GPL) information related to the organization\u2019s headquarters.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
